---
import { getWhatsAppLink } from '../../../lib/utils';

interface Props {
  lang?: 'id' | 'en';
}

const { lang = 'id' } = Astro.props;

const templateTitle = lang === 'en' ? "Template 01: Corporate Company Profile" : "Template 01: Company Profile Korporat";
const templatePrice = "Rp 350.000";
const buyUrl = getWhatsAppLink('template', lang, templateTitle);
const catalogUrl = `/${lang}/templates`;
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang={lang} class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>{templateTitle} - Live Demo</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/styles/globals.css" />
</head>
<body class="bg-[#F8FAFC] text-[#0F172A] font-sans antialiased selection:bg-[#2563EB] selection:text-white">

  {/* Fixed Top Demo Bar (ala Web Ekspor) */}
  <header class="sticky top-0 z-50 bg-[#0F172A] text-white px-4 py-2.5 text-xs flex items-center justify-between shadow-md">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <a 
        href={catalogUrl} 
        class="text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer"
      >
        <span>←</span>
        <span>{lang === 'en' ? 'Back to Catalog' : 'Kembali ke Katalog'}</span>
      </a>
      <span class="text-slate-600 hidden sm:inline">|</span>
      <span class="font-semibold text-slate-200 hidden sm:inline">{templateTitle}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <span class="text-slate-300 font-mono hidden md:inline">{templatePrice} {lang === 'en' ? '(One-time)' : '(Sekali Bayar)'}</span>
      <a
        href={buyUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="bg-[#2563EB] hover:bg-blue-600 text-white font-medium px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded text-xs transition-colors cursor-pointer"
      >
        {lang === 'en' ? 'Purchase Template' : 'Beli Template Ini'}
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  {/* Company Profile Navbar */}
  <nav class="border-b border-slate-200 bg-white/95 backdrop-blur-md sticky top-[41px] z-40">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-8">
        <a href="#home" class="font-black text-lg tracking-tight text-slate-900 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded bg-slate-900 text-white flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">E</span>
          <span>ELEVATE<span class="text-[#2563EB]">CORP</span></span>
        </a>
        <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600">
          <a href="#about" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Tentang Kami</a>
          <a href="#services" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Layanan</a>
          <a href="#portfolio" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Portofolio</a>
          <a href="#contact" class="hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors">Kontak</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a 
          href="#contact" 
          class="text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-900 text-white hover:bg-slate-800 px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-colors cursor-pointer"
        >
          Hubungi Kami
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  {/* Hero Section */}
  <section id="home" class="py-16 sm:py-24 px-4 sm:px-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center">
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-full px-3.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-blue-700 mb-6">
      <span>●</span>
      <span>Solusi Bisnis &amp; Industri Terpercaya</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 leading-[1.15] max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      Membangun Keunggulan Bisnis dengan Integritas &amp; Profesionalisme
    </h1>

    <p class="mt-5 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
      Mitra strategis terpercaya dalam konsultasi korporat, manajemen rekayasa, dan efisiensi operasional. Membantu perusahaan berkembang dengan standar mutu internasional.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
      <a href="#contact" class="w-full sm:w-auto text-xs font-semibold bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">
        Konsultasi Proyek
      </a>
      <a href="#portfolio" class="w-full sm:w-auto text-xs font-medium bg-white hover:bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 text-slate-800 px-6 py-3 rounded-lg transition-colors">
        Lihat Portofolio
      </a>
    </div>

    {/* Key Metrics / Highlights */}
    <div class="mt-14 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-left">
        <div class="border-l-2 border-blue-600 pl-4">
          <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">12+</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Tahun Pengalaman</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-blue-600 pl-4">
          <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">250+</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Proyek Selesai</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-blue-600 pl-4">
          <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">98%</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Kepuasan Klien</div>
        </div>
        <div class="border-l-2 border-blue-600 pl-4">
          <div class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-slate-900">ISO 9001</div>
          <div class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Sertifikasi Mutu</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* About Section */}
  <section id="about" class="py-16 bg-white border-t border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600">Tentang Perusahaan</span>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mt-2">
            Dedikasi Menghadirkan Hasil Nyata untuk Setiap Klien
          </h2>
          <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
            Berdiri sejak tahun 2014, kami telah dipercaya oleh berbagai institusi swasta dan BUMN untuk menangani proyek-proyek penting. Pendekatan kami bertumpu pada analisis mendalam, perencanaan disiplin, dan eksekusi presisi.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-6 space-y-2.5 text-xs text-slate-700">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Tim profesional bersertifikasi kompetensi resmi</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Transparansi anggaran dan pelaporan berkala</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">✓ Dukungan purna jual dan garansi pekerjaan</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-slate-100 rounded-xl p-6 border border-slate-200 space-y-4">
          <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Visi Kami</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">Menjadi grup usaha penyedia solusi industri nomor satu yang diakui atas inovasi dan integritasnya di kawasan Asia Tenggara.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded-lg border border-slate-200">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Misi Kami</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-1">Memberikan layanan bernilai tambah tinggi, menjaga keselamatan kerja tanpa kompromi, dan memberdayakan talenta lokal berdaya saing global.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Services Section */}
  <section id="services" class="py-16 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="text-center max-w-xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600">Layanan Unggulan</span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mt-1">Solusi Menyeluruh untuk Kebutuhan Anda</h2>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2">Dukungan komprehensif dari tahap perencanaan awal hingga operasional lanjutan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-base font-bold mb-4">01</div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Konsultasi Manajemen</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Perumusan rencana strategis, audit efisiensi alur kerja, dan optimalisasi rantai pasok perusahaan.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-base font-bold mb-4">02</div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Rekayasa &amp; Konstruksi</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Pengerjaan fasilitas industri dan infrastruktur sipil dengan standar keselamatan dan durabilitas tinggi.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white shadow-xs">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 flex items-center justify-center text-base font-bold mb-4">03</div>
          <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900">Pengadaan &amp; Logistik</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 leading-relaxed">
            Pengadaan peralatan operasional berspesifikasi ketat serta distribusi barang tepat waktu ke berbagai lokasi.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Contact / CTA Section */}
  <section id="contact" class="py-16 bg-white border-t border-slate-200">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 text-center">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900">Siap Mendiskusikan Proyek Anda?</h2>
      <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 mt-2 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        Hubungi tim konsultan kami untuk sesi konsultasi awal tanpa biaya. Kami siap memberikan solusi yang tepat bagi kebutuhan bisnis Anda.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a 
          href={buyUrl} 
          target="_blank" 
          rel="noopener noreferrer" 
          class="text-xs font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg bg-[#2563EB] hover:bg-blue-600 text-white transition-colors cursor-pointer"
        >
          Beli Template Ini ({templatePrice})
        </a>
        <a 
          href={catalogUrl} 
          class="text-xs font-medium px-6 py-3 rounded-lg border border-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-50 text-slate-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
        >
          Lihat Template Lainnya
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Footer */}
  <footer class="border-t border-slate-200 bg-slate-900 text-slate-400 py-10 text-center text-xs">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4">
      <p class="text-slate-300 font-semibold">PT Elevate Solusi Korporat Indonesia</p>
      <p class="text-slate-500 mt-1">Gedung Bursa Efek Indonesia, Tower 2 Lt. 17, Jakarta Selatan</p>
      <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-800">
        <a href={catalogUrl} class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">← {lang === 'en' ? 'Back to Gilabs Template Catalog' : 'Kembali ke Katalog Template Gilabs'}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
